{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SketchClub 是一款集素描、繪畫、塗鴉、上色與相片編輯於一身的創作應用，適合喜歡畫畫、製作漫畫，或想透過每日挑戰與社群交流保持創作動力的 iPhone 及 iPad 用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-237.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>豐富筆刷與每日挑戰</h2>\n<p>內置筆刷、鉛筆、像素、向量、模糊、塗抹、填色與文字等工具，並支援數百層圖層、即時濾鏡、變形、鏡像及最高 16K 畫布；亦可匯出 PSD、動畫 GIF 與 1080 HD 畫布錄影。社群每天推出新繪畫挑戰，每週有新比賽，還可分享筆刷、模板與材質，並在直播聊天中交流。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-243-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-244-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-245-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-246-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-247-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-248-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SketchClub: Draw &amp; Paint</li><li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sketchclub-draw-paint/id404414176?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.704947+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:58:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T23:36:36.346428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:24.048770+00:00","content_hash":"2cf952149c6bc1dfd3df24d0905605706e0db98ed8f87abb0b7848bd71430bcc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}